      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey im at this new place for dinner and i think i had something i'm allergic to. i have these itchy red hives all over my chest and stomach and my throat feels kinda tight like i cant swallow perfectly. should i just take a benadryl and wait to see if it goes away or is this a big deal??",
